{
  "kind": "classes",
  "title": "LouisAgent.Evals: the interface design of the file",
  "caption": "An eval file is three records, one inside the other, and a fact is its kind and its one argument. The reader makes them from the file's text, and the schema is made from the same records.",
  "classes": {
    "types": [
      {
        "id": "file",
        "name": "EvalFile",
        "kind": "record",
